refused: d306_a_shuffle_while_running.cy:6:53, line 6 column 53
 6 |     let $r: simd<i32>[lanes: 1] = $v.%shuffle(pos: [$n]);
   |                                                     ^^
 fix:  `.%lookup`
 why:  CPUs bake a shuffle's pattern into the instruction, and a table lookup is a slower, separate thing (D304, D306)
